A replacement without transaction prices still reports a missing opening lot cost.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity NEW
  format 1,000.000000 NEW
commodity OLD
  format 1,000.0000 OLD
account Assets:Shares
account Equity:Opening
2022-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Shares  1.9619 OLD
  Equity:Opening  -1.9619 OLD
2022-12-12 Replacement
  Assets:Shares  4.051281 NEW {{350 SEK}}
  Assets:Shares  -1.9619 OLD {{350 SEK}}

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Positive OLD posting must use a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and no transaction price (@ or @@), except when both prices are zero; the default commodity is SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:3

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Negative OLD posting must use both a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and a transaction price (@ or @@); the default commodity is SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:15:3

[NEGATIVE_POSTING_DATE_HOLDING] Equity:Opening: holding is -1.9619 OLD on 2022-01-01 using posting dates; disposals must not precede available acquisitions
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:3

